          "text": "Yamara wewe, Uhoraho, urazi imihigo bampigiye yose yo kunyica; ntuharire igicumuro cabo, ntusibanganye icaha cabo ngo kive mu nyonga zawe: ariko batsindwe imbere yawe; abe ari k’ubagirira mu gihe c’uburake bgawe.",
